{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:174","content":{"id":174,"title":"17 烹饪美味的受体菜谱","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08f41f6b-abc0-4e1a-a4bf-1e48eed070f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有生物的基本部件相同，部件主体是蛋白质，免疫细胞通过和细菌的蛋白质结合，识别和俘获细菌。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d5d0b2ff-713d-4d22-b552-161d73a66fa1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先天免疫系统通过 Toll 样受体识别细菌表面常见的蛋白质，有限。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"faac0af2-d565-4313-9f8a-911315b35888","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"能被免疫系统识别的蛋白块叫抗原，有几亿种抗原先天性免疫系统无法识别。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"b179654b-9299-4567-b473-5b89e3c248b0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"819f7b52-3d7c-4287-a7e3-3ed54adf60d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"抗原是免疫系统能够识别的异物结构。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f53740c-246e-4f44-ba08-7b81de101eb6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"适应性免疫系统的解决办法，体内至少存在一个免疫细胞，可以识别几亿抗原中某种特定抗原的受体。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"4308a2cc-ee16-4240-ae0b-ddf1f4fe3515","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e1997e72-5fac-4ed9-bdd0-1894d7af217d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那就是存了很多不同的免疫细胞，出生就有，基因带来的吧！那每个人会不一样吗？会有的人多，有的人少吗？不一样的话，有办法让没有的人受益吗？"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6fbe4979-7052-4408-a03c-38e1388c1660","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基因组这么少，是怎么编码出这么多受体蛋白的？基因片段精妙的混合搭配，选取不同的基因片段随机组合，再随机加入或删去一些部分，得到几十亿种不同受体。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d5ef53b-b7b2-40a1-ab76-32cb2d44c3b6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"生成这么多的受体，如何不把自身的一部分的当成抗原呢？"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"17 烹饪美味的受体菜谱","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:174","type":"doc","id":174}}],"prevPage":{"title":"16 宇宙最大的图书馆","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:173","type":"doc","id":173}},"nextPage":{"title":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:175","type":"doc","id":175}},"createTime":1740015993569,"updateTime":1756124013718,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124013718}}